1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,600
? 超級碗 ?
♪ Oh, Super Bowl ♪

2
00:00:03,295 --> 00:00:07,045
? 精彩比賽 比賽精彩 萬眾期待 ?
♪ The plays, the plays, they're calling ♪

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:09,940
? 從一端到另一端 ?
♪ From end to end ♪

4
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:10,860
? 還有啊 ?
♪ And -- ♪

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,020
發生什么事了
What happened?

6
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,880
要我撥打9和1還再加一個1嗎
Do I call the nine and the one and the other one?

7
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:19,120
為什么我的冰箱都是與橄欖球無關的食物
Why is my fridge filled with non-football-related foods

8
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,080
今天可是有超級碗大賽的星期天
on Super Bowl Sunday?

9
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,960
都沒地方放我的杰瑞·賴斯布丁了
There's no room for my Jerry Rice pudding.

10
00:00:22,136 --> 00:00:23,486
今天是海莉的迎嬰派對
Haley's baby shower is today.

11
00:00:23,486 --> 00:00:25,047
我大概一個月前就跟你說過了
I cleared it with you, like, a month ago.

12
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,460
你就不能把比賽錄下來嗎
Can't you just record the game?

13
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,960
然后呢 明早再看嗎
And what? Watch it tomorrow morning?

14
00:00:28,246 --> 00:00:30,886
為什么橄欖球比賽和迎嬰派對
Look. There's no reason a football game and a baby shower

15
00:00:30,886 --> 00:00:32,466
就不能同處一個屋檐下呢
can't co-exist under the same roof.

16
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,600
你們應該也不會打擾到我
Maybe you won't get in my way.

17
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,960
迎嬰派對挺平淡的
Baby showers are pretty tame.

18
00:00:35,036 --> 00:00:38,813
迎嬰派對啊啊的朋友們 你們好哇
Who's ready for a baby show-ahhh?!

19
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:59,060
我在為迎嬰派對啊啊做白色俄羅斯人
I'm making White Russians for the baby show-ahhh.

20
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,160
一點液體勇氣能讓"壞壞游戲"更好玩
A little liquid courage makes all the naughty games better.

21
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,120
我覺得你把迎嬰派對和婚前派對搞混了
I think you're mixing up baby shower with bridal shower.

22
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:07,820
我的婚前派對就是在我懷孕的時候舉行的
Well, my bridal shower did take place when I was pregnant.

23
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,500
"警察"[舞男]都來了
The cops even showed up.

24
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,680
當然了 他們不是真警察
Of course, they weren't real cops.

25
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:13,240
其中一個還用屁股蹭我的肚子
One of them rubbed his butt against my belly.

26
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,360
別跟海莉說
Don't tell Haley.

27
00:01:14,638 --> 00:01:16,348
不如"別跟艾麗克斯說"
Or how about, "Don't tell Alex"?

28
00:01:16,980 --> 00:01:18,820
超級碗投注站來啦
Super Bowl squares here!

29
00:01:18,820 --> 00:01:20,380
快給你的超級碗下注吧
Get your Super Bowl squares!

30
00:01:20,688 --> 00:01:22,078
別 別又來一次
No. Not this again.

31
00:01:22,078 --> 00:01:23,608
其實我們做了一點改良
Uh, actually, we've made some refinements.

32
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,320
去年的價格有點太高了
Last year, the price was a little high.

33
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,260
前年又太低了
The year before, too low.

34
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,820
所以今年 我們確定了一個完美的數額
So this year, we've landed on the perfect number.

35
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,800
每注3.75美元
$3.75 per square.

36
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:32,420
我會跟去年一樣
I'll do what I did last year.

37
00:01:32,740 --> 00:01:35,220
-給我11注 -行啊 容易得很
- Give me 11 squares. - Okay. Easy enough.

38
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:41,280
不要在迎嬰派對這邊搞什么超級碗的算術
No. No Super Bowl math on the baby shower side.

39
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,040
到那邊去
Go over there.

40
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:44,840
我告訴你 你真的看起來很棒
I'm telling you, you look cute.

41
00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,800
你知道什么不棒嗎 對我撒謊
You know what's not cute? Lying to me.

42
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:49,340
孩子出生后 脾氣就會改了吧
This gets better once they come out, right?

43
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:52,040
-怎么了 -我的上一條牛仔褲穿不上了
- What happened? - Well, my last pair of jeans exploded,

44
00:01:52,140 --> 00:01:54,540
我不能穿裙子 因為我的大腿長毛了
I can't wear skirts because my thighs are growing hair

45
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:55,780
剃都剃不及
faster than I can shave it,

46
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:57,960
所以我只能穿著滑雪褲來參加自己的迎嬰派對
so I'm wearing ski pants to my own baby shower.

47
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,930
我告訴你 沒人會注意到的
I'm telling you, no one's even gonna notice.

48
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,040
那是什么聲音 聽起來好像
What's that sound? It's like

49
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,100
進取號星艦艙門開啟的聲音
when the doors on the starship Enterprise open.

50
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:08,080
你們想給超級碗下注嗎
Hey, you guys want to buy a Super Bowl square?

51
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,040
每注只要3.75美元噢
Only $3.75.

52
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:10,920
酷 我能要三注嗎
Cool. Can I take three squares?

53
00:02:11,071 --> 00:02:12,721
是啊 我今天得有點好事
Yeah, I need something good today, too.

54
00:02:12,721 --> 00:02:14,202
我們合買五注
We'll split five squares.

55
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:16,060
你有零錢嗎
Uh...do you have quarters?

56
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,620
上次我被閃電打中之后
Oh, I don't carry change

57
00:02:17,620 --> 00:02:19,380
我就不隨身帶著零錢了
since the last time I got struck by lightning.

58
00:02:23,251 --> 00:02:24,541
你好 菲利普
Hello, Phillip.

59
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:25,660
你好 曼尼爾
Hello, Manuel.

60
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:27,960
違背我明智的判斷力
Against my better judgment,

61
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,940
我在新電影里為菲爾寫了一段戲
I wrote a part for Phil in my new movie.

62
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:32,820
后來事態有些劍拔弩張 兩人間唇槍舌劍
Things got heated, words were exchanged,

63
00:02:33,181 --> 00:02:36,222
這點還挺令人意外 嘴這么利說臺詞卻這么愚鈍
which is surprising, considering he had a mouthful of scenery.

64
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,120
演員啊
Actors.

65
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,140
編劇啊 他們自視甚高
Writers. They think they're so great.

66
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,360
"我寫的詞真是字字珠璣"
"Oh, my words are so precious."

67
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,860
學著傾聽一下吧
Try listening for once.

68
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,800
那樣你或許會知道人究竟是怎么說話的
Maybe you'll learn how humans actually talk.

69
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:47,840
等等 是"說"還是"曰"來著
Wait, is it -- is it "talk" or "speak"?

70
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,240
想起來了
Oh, that's right.

71
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,520
根本沒人在意
No one cares!

72
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:53,960
大家好 我來看超級碗大賽啦
Hello, hello. I'm here for the Super Bowl.

73
00:02:54,242 --> 00:02:55,992
-我是來參加迎嬰派對的 -行 好
- And I am here for the baby shower. - Okay, yep.

74
00:02:55,992 --> 00:02:58,053
我好像是來受什么刑的
I'm here for some sort of punishment, I think.

75
00:02:58,053 --> 00:03:00,783
莉莉和她朋友克里斯蒂娜大吵一架
Hmm. Lily and her friend, Christina, got into a huge fight.

76
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,900
我希望我們能夠
And I was hoping we could

77
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:03,680
讓她們坐下來好好聊聊
have the girls sit down and talk it out.

78
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,660
但米奇爾說"不 克里斯蒂娜是錯的"
But Mitchell said "No, Christina's in the wrong."

79
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:07,700
很顯然 米奇爾言出法隨
And apparently, Mitchell's the law.

80
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:11,440
他確實是 莉莉 你真幸運有個這樣睿智的爸爸
He is. Lily, you're very lucky to have such a wise papa.

81
00:03:11,573 --> 00:03:14,993
普里契特助理地檢是個英雄
Mm-hmm. Assistant District Attorney Pritchett is a hero.

82
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:17,160
所以這人現在覺得你酷斃了
Huh. So this one thinks you're cool now?

83
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,500
歌洛莉亞喜歡犯罪故事
Okay, Gloria loves crime stories,

84
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,200
特別是殺夫的女人那種
especially women who kill their husbands.

85
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:24,420
最近我起訴了貝艾爾市的黑寡婦
And I recently prosecuted the Bel Air Black Widow.

86
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,320
她每天都有來法庭
She came to court every single day.

87
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,490
我們認為被告有罪
We find the defendant guilty.

88
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:31,160
太好了
Yes! Whoop, whoop!

89
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:34,080
律師 這事兒沒完
Hey, Counselor. This isn't over.

90
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,820
女士 你就像高中的我一樣
Lady, you're like me in high school,

91
00:03:35,944 --> 00:03:38,444
因為你17年內都別想出來[出柜]
cause you ain't gonna be coming out for 17 years!

92
00:03:38,580 --> 00:03:40,460
虐了一個外焦內嫩
Boom goes the dynamite!

93
00:03:42,324 --> 00:03:45,635
小卡 來一碗我的知名辣椒醬
Cam, have a bowl of my famous chili.

94
00:03:45,635 --> 00:03:47,076
我都不知道你做了這個
I didn't know you made chili.

95
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:49,500
我對杰該死的辣椒醬熟得很
I know all about Jay's damn chili.

96
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,020
就在去年的同一天我們還聊過
We talked about it last year on this very day.

97
00:03:52,380 --> 00:03:53,400
我們還做了約定
Promises were made.

98
00:03:53,860 --> 00:03:55,880
明年 我會給你買一把你自己的橄欖球椅
Next year, I'm getting you your own football chair

99
00:03:55,935 --> 00:03:58,065
你來幫忙我做我的知名辣椒醬
and you're gonna help me make my famous chili.

100
00:03:58,075 --> 00:03:59,266
凌晨五點
5: 00 a.M.

101
00:03:59,595 --> 00:04:02,395
不見不散
Be there or be square.

102
00:04:02,535 --> 00:04:04,645
我從未完全感受到杰的認同
You know, I never entirely felt Jay's approval,

103
00:04:04,660 --> 00:04:06,340
所以這對我們來說是一大步
so this was a big step for us.

104
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,440
我每天都數著日子
I counted the days.

105
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,760
然后超級碗的前夕
Then Super Bowl Eve,

106
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:11,200
我去了 還買了最好的辣椒醬增稠劑
I went and I bought the finest chili thickeners --

107
00:04:11,460 --> 00:04:13,160
玉米面粉還有土豆面粉
corn flour and potato flour.

108
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:15,480
我在黎明前一小時出現
And I showed up an hour before dawn.

109
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:18,860
為了不嚇到歌洛莉亞 我給杰打了電話
I called Jay's cell as to not startle Gloria.

110
00:04:19,380 --> 00:04:20,280
什么事啊
Hey, what's up?

111
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:23,140
他完全沒意識到我為什么打給他
He had no idea why I was calling.

112
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:26,300
承諾很明顯對他來說一點都不重要
Clearly promises made didn't mean as much to him.

113
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,800
但是我不能讓他知道
But I couldn't let him know that.

114
00:04:27,826 --> 00:04:30,017
杰 是你嗎
Oh, uh, Jay, is th-- is that you?

115
00:04:30,017 --> 00:04:32,727
我肯定是沒鎖屏按到了
I-I must -- I must've butt-dialed you.

116
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,200
不然我為什么要在一個這么平常的
Why else would I be calling you so early...

117
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,780
周日早晨給你打電話呢
...on a regular Sunday morning?

118
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:36,580
抱歉
Sorry.

119
00:04:37,340 --> 00:04:38,780
我覺得自己被負心漢拋棄了
I felt like a jilted lover

120
00:04:38,837 --> 00:04:41,957
站在他的門廊前 手里拿著美麗的面粉[音同鮮花]
standing on his porch, holding those beautiful flours.

121
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,660
你不能躲在這一整天
You can't hide in here all day.

122
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,300
我覺得你現在的樣子最性感
To me, you've never been hotter,

123
00:04:48,397 --> 00:04:49,927
而我可是看過比你穿比基尼搭便車時的樣子呢
and I've seen you hitchhike in a bikini.

124
00:04:49,927 --> 00:04:51,048
你在這啊
There you are.

125
00:04:51,277 --> 00:04:53,498
很遺憾你今天過得不太好
I'm sorry you're having a bad day, uh...

126
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:56,420
不過我覺得應該告訴你 我邀請了丹妮爾
but I thought you should know, I invited Danielle.

127
00:04:56,538 --> 00:04:58,968
丹妮爾 她太討人厭了
Danielle? Ugh, she's so annoying.

128
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,220
她說的每句話聽著都像個問句咩
Everything she says sounds like a question?

129
00:05:01,540 --> 00:05:02,580
但其實不是咩
But it's not?

130
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:04,620
是啊 但是她正處在
Yeah, but she's in her, like,

131
00:05:04,620 --> 00:05:06,360
第好多個月的孕期
thousandth month of pregnancy.

132
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,460
天啊
Oh, my God.

133
00:05:07,618 --> 00:05:09,388
那我就不是這里最丑的孕婦了
That means I won't be the grossest preggo here.

134
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:10,260
太愛你了
Bless you.

135
00:05:12,260 --> 00:05:12,760
謝謝
Thanks.

136
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,900
謝謝你今天邀請我過來
And thanks for inviting me today.

137
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:16,780
當然了 你是孩子的爸爸
Of course. You're the baby's father.

138
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:18,740
是 但是這是家庭聚會
Yeah, but it's a family thing,

139
00:05:18,740 --> 00:05:20,520
而我一直覺得不能融入你們
and I don't always feel like I belong.

140
00:05:20,859 --> 00:05:21,959
有的時候他們看我就像
Sometimes they look at me like

141
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:24,249
俗話中的"掃興使[屎]者"一樣
the proverbial bird in the punch bowl.

142
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:25,640
難得只錯一個字
Almost.

143
00:05:26,780 --> 00:05:28,340
三乘
Uh, three times...

144
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:30,040
不好意思 不過不管你怎么看
I'm sorry, but every way you look at it,

145
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,960
迪蘭的錢數不對[不夠格]
Dylan comes up short.

146
00:05:31,139 --> 00:05:32,989
海莉完全就被騙了
And Haley's totally getting rooked.

147
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,640
好吧 這有點意思
Oh! Okay, well, that's interesting.

148
00:05:35,689 --> 00:05:38,279
他們在郡監獄里找不到黑寡婦了
Um, they lost track of the Black Widow at the county jail.

149
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,641
-她越獄了 -是啊
- She escaped? - Mm-hmm.

150
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:41,740
-你害怕嗎 -開什么玩笑
- Are you scared? - What?!

151
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,120
就是嘛
Exactly!

152
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,400
應該害怕的是她
She should be scared of you.

153
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:49,420
如果她夠聰明 就應該逃得遠遠的
If she's smart, that young lady will run and keep running.

154
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:54,120
這里面放了什么調料
What spice is in here?

155
00:05:54,180 --> 00:05:55,461
是茴香嗎
Is it -- Is that dill?

156
00:05:55,670 --> 00:05:56,970
里面放茴香[迪蘭在這]干什么
Why the hell is dill in here?

157
00:05:56,970 --> 00:05:58,620
真是災難啊
It's a -- It's a catastrophe.

158
00:06:03,860 --> 00:06:06,500
我重新利用一下這里的一點頭發
So, I'm just gonna repurpose some of this hair

159
00:06:06,561 --> 00:06:08,681
蓋住禿處和青春痘
to cover the bald spot and zits --

160
00:06:08,681 --> 00:06:11,931
-還有青春痘 -全"痘"會看起來美美的
- Zits?! - And "Zits" Gonna look amazing.

161
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:12,460
完成啦
Ta da!

162
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,660
-成了嗎 -是啊
- Ta da?! - Yeah.

163
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:17,000
我真有膽梳這種遮禿發型
I have a huge gut and a comb-over.

164
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,740
看上去像個離了婚的牙醫
I look like a divorced dentist.

165
00:06:20,731 --> 00:06:22,211
丹妮爾
Oh, Danielle!

166
00:06:22,211 --> 00:06:24,351
你看起來真不錯 為什么
You look so good. Why?

167
00:06:24,351 --> 00:06:27,622
是懷孕的魔力咩 話題"老天保佑"
It's the magic of pregnancy? #Blessed?

168
00:06:27,940 --> 00:06:28,760
什么情況
What the hell?!

169
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:30,660
艾麗克斯說我可以早點過來
Alex said it was okay if I came early?

170
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:33,520
海莉 我真為你高興
Haley, I'm so happy for you?

171
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:35,240
我需要迪蘭 迪蘭呢
I need Dylan. Where is Dylan?

172
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:35,920
迪蘭去哪了
Where's Dylan?

173
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,620
海莉找不到他的
Haley's not gonna find Dylan.

174
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:41,000
他走了
He's gone,

175
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,940
你們每個人都有錯
and it's everybody's fault!

176
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:47,080
怎么都哭喪著個臉
What is up with all the funeral faces?

177
00:06:47,202 --> 00:06:48,473
來嗨呀 大伙 這可是
Come on, people, this is supposed to be

178
00:06:48,473 --> 00:06:50,663
-迎嬰派對啊啊 -別再這么稱呼了
- a baby show-ahhh. - Don't say "Show-ahhh".

179
00:06:50,663 --> 00:06:51,933
沒人覺得好
Nobody wants it.

180
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,680
好吧 所以迪蘭誤會了我們
Okay. So, Dylan misunderstood

181
00:06:55,693 --> 00:06:58,613
說的一些話 傷了感情走了
a bunch of the things he heard us say, got upset, and ran off.

182
00:06:58,620 --> 00:07:00,700
我們就別假裝是什么誤會
Let's not pretend this was some mistake

183
00:07:00,700 --> 00:07:02,600
或者迪蘭太敏感了
or Dylan being oversensitive.

184
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,080
我們都做了很多讓他覺得
We've all given him plenty of reasons

185
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,720
在這個家里不受歡迎的事
to feel unwelcome in this family.

186
00:07:05,943 --> 00:07:07,773
有的人確實很無情
And some of us do have a meanness.

187
00:07:08,073 --> 00:07:11,023
我就這么說吧 毫無人性的殘酷
I'll leave it at that. A monstrous cruelty.

188
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,060
簡而言之 就是虐待狂
Enough said. Sadistic.

189
00:07:12,420 --> 00:07:13,740
我們家就挺冷靜的
My family is really chill?

190
00:07:13,844 --> 00:07:15,434
就不該讓你來
You were a mistake.

191
00:07:15,700 --> 00:07:17,480
好了 盧克拖住了海莉
Okay, Haley's being occupied by Luke,

192
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,420
所以我們還有些時間
so we have some time.

193
00:07:18,780 --> 00:07:19,960
我們得找到迪蘭
We just have to find Dylan

194
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,080
不能讓海莉知道他跑掉了
without letting Haley know he's run away.

195
00:07:22,204 --> 00:07:24,224
不過這聽著是迎嬰派對的問題
That kind of sounds like a shower problem, though.

196
00:07:24,224 --> 00:07:25,354
我不是很理解為什么要
I don't know how fair it is to bring in

197
00:07:25,354 --> 00:07:26,894
把看超級碗的人攪和進來
the Super Bowl folk into this.

198
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:30,940
我的姐姐給了我這個機會為她辦迎嬰派對
My big sister gave me the honor of hosting her shower,

199
00:07:30,940 --> 00:07:32,780
我就要辦得漂漂亮亮
and it's gonna be great.

200
00:07:33,074 --> 00:07:34,364
所以 唯一可能知道
So, the one person

201
00:07:34,364 --> 00:07:36,325
迪蘭去了哪里的人 也就是海莉
who might know where Dylan went, Haley,

202
00:07:36,325 --> 00:07:38,395
卻不能知道他不見了
is the one person who can't know he's missing.

203
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,300
這就是我所稱的戲劇性的一幕
That's what I call a dramatic situation.

204
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:42,940
你不是應該趁勢大導特導一下這部戲嗎
Shouldn't you be directing the life out of it?

205
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:45,500
喬 迪蘭不高興的時候喜歡去哪
Joe, where does Dylan like to go when he's depressed?

206
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,140
艾麗克斯 他喜歡迪蘭沒錯 但也沒有
Alex, he likes him, but it's not like --

207
00:07:48,140 --> 00:07:49,900
公園 寵物店 吉他店
Park, pet store, guitar shop.

208
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:52,860
怎么 我關注他的照片分享網了
What? I follow his Instagram.

209
00:07:53,095 --> 00:07:54,765
他有雙發現美的眼睛
He finds beauty in the mundane.

210
00:07:54,765 --> 00:07:57,015
好 我們分頭找迪蘭
Okay. We'll search for Dylan in teams.

211
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:58,760
-米奇 歌洛莉亞 找公園 -太好了
- Mitch, Gloria -- park. - Score.

212
00:07:58,976 --> 00:08:01,066
吉他店 小卡 杰
Guitar store -- Cam, Jay.

213
00:08:01,066 --> 00:08:03,276
寵物店 菲爾 曼尼 走吧
And the pet store -- Phil, Manny, go.

214
00:08:03,276 --> 00:08:04,986
-我能換個... -你想把漂亮臉蛋
- Actually, could I trade? - Your pretty face

215
00:08:04,986 --> 00:08:07,336
換成被打得腫起來的臉嗎 來試試看啊
for one that's been freshly whooped? Try me!

216
00:08:07,336 --> 00:08:08,336
我可不可以...
Would it be possible if I could --

217
00:08:08,336 --> 00:08:10,606
-快走 -算了 到店里再去洗手間好了
- Move! - Ah, they'll have a bathroom at the store.

218
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,740
他沒卡在旋轉滑梯里
He's not stuck in the tube slide.

219
00:08:15,916 --> 00:08:17,196
去兒童節目主持人去世時
Ah, it was too much to hope he'd be

220
00:08:17,196 --> 00:08:19,356
他躲起來的地方找他的確有點勉強
where we found him when Mister Rogers died.

221
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,100
"你惹錯老娘了 我來找你了"
"You messed with the wrong girl. I'm coming for you."

222
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,860
這人是誰
Who is this?

223
00:08:26,527 --> 00:08:27,928
貝爾艾爾區號
That's Bel Air.

224
00:08:28,417 --> 00:08:31,837
黑寡婦越獄后就開始威脅你了
The Black Widow is out and already threatening you?

225
00:08:31,837 --> 00:08:32,958
太好了
This is good.

226
00:08:32,997 --> 00:08:35,567
你可以抓住她 再做一次英雄
You get to catch her and be a hero again.

227
00:08:35,567 --> 00:08:37,947
或許我該給黑寡婦發條信息
You know, maybe I should-I should send the Black Widow

228
00:08:37,947 --> 00:08:40,117
告訴她"只是公事公辦 別記仇"
a-a "no hard feelings" text.

229
00:08:40,117 --> 00:08:41,047
-不 -不
- No. - No?

230
00:08:41,047 --> 00:08:42,597
你在庭上說的都是對的
What you said in court was right.

231
00:08:42,597 --> 00:08:44,838
那個禽獸不值得姑息
That animal deserved no mercy.

232
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,020
她活該被關在籠子里
She deserves a cage.

233
00:08:46,178 --> 00:08:48,978
我說了些狠話 她也說了些狠話
Well, you know, I said some things, she said some things.

234
00:08:48,978 --> 00:08:49,988
這 等等
It's -- Wait, um...

235
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:53,020
"我不怕 放馬過來"
"I am not afraid. Bring it on."

236
00:08:53,038 --> 00:08:54,088
好吧
I -- Oh, okay.

237
00:08:54,088 --> 00:08:55,998
所有惡霸都一樣
All bullies are the same.

238
00:08:56,018 --> 00:08:57,498
他們裝出一副狠相
They act like they're tough,

239
00:08:57,498 --> 00:08:59,728
可當你朝他們鼻子來一拳 他們就縮了
but when you punch 'em in the nose, they back down.

240
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:00,600
是啊
Yeah.

241
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:05,420
"我知道你住哪 你死定了"
"I know where you live. You're dead."

242
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:07,740
這種回復很罕見
That response is rare.

243
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,300
他在這
There he is.

244
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,120
迪蘭
Dylan.

245
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,940
迪蘭
Hey, Dylan!

246
00:09:15,780 --> 00:09:16,660
抱歉
Oh, sorry.

247
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:20,519
這是我第三次犯完全一樣的錯誤了
That's the third time I've made that exact same mistake.

248
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:22,989
讓我開始質疑越戰時的一些約會對象
Makes me wonder about some of my dates in 'Nam.

249
00:09:23,239 --> 00:09:25,099
他不在這 我們走
Well, he ain't here. Let's go.

250
00:09:25,099 --> 00:09:28,149
我知名的辣椒醬從凌晨五點就在燉了
My famous chili has been simmering since 5:00 a.m.

251
00:09:29,009 --> 00:09:29,919
說來有趣
Y-you know, it is funny

252
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:31,740
你一直說你的辣椒醬"知名"
that you keep calling your chili "famous"

253
00:09:31,740 --> 00:09:33,480
可我覺得有點
when I find it a little...

254
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:34,800
吃過就忘
forgettable.

255
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:37,560
小卡 我是個成功的男人
Cam, I'm a successful man.

256
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:38,960
業界巨頭
Captain of industry,

257
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,700
跟嘉寶姐妹之一親熱過
made out with a Gabor sister,

258
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:43,320
假如我能在董事會再拉點票
and if I can swing a few more board votes,

259
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,760
我們在俄亥俄州的
we break ground on

260
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:47,860
普里切特衣櫥科學院就能破土動工
the Pritchett School of Closet Science at Ohio State.

261
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,940
我真不在乎你怎么看我的辣椒醬
Not really sweating your take on my chili.

262
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:52,400
他傷我至深
He'd hurt me deeply.

263
00:09:53,130 --> 00:09:54,911
我一直提辣椒醬是因為
I kept mentioning chili 'cause, you know,

264
00:09:54,940 --> 00:09:56,240
我想刺激一下他的記憶
I was trying to jog his memory,

265
00:09:56,451 --> 00:09:58,471
因為我們本該一起做的
'cause we were supposed to make it together.

266
00:09:58,581 --> 00:10:01,881
我一輩子都想找個專門一起看超級碗的伙伴
I've waited my whole life for a special Super Bowl buddy,

267
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:04,200
能明白這不只是一場球賽的人
someone who understands it isn't just a game.

268
00:10:04,571 --> 00:10:06,571
這是場15小時 4頓飯
It's a 15-hour, 4-meal,

269
00:10:06,571 --> 00:10:08,551
2件上衣 1次打盹的體驗
2-shirt, 1-nap experience,

270
00:10:08,551 --> 00:10:11,041
我以為小卡會是那個伙伴
and I thought Cam could be that buddy.

271
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:12,740
然后我開始擔心
Then I started worrying

272
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:15,160
小卡或許忘了我們一年前的約定
Cam might forget a date we set a year ago.

273
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,300
他還記得
He remembered.

274
00:10:19,302 --> 00:10:20,743
他還記得 斯黛拉
He remembered, Stella!

275
00:10:21,912 --> 00:10:22,983
冷靜點
Be cool.

276
00:10:24,780 --> 00:10:25,580
怎么了
Hey, what's up?

277
00:10:27,722 --> 00:10:28,793
沒鎖屏按到了
Oh, butt-dial.

278
00:10:28,900 --> 00:10:30,020
不 我明白
No, I see.

279
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,120
是啊 沒事
Yeah, take it easy.

280
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:44,700
鼻子印 男性 高個子
Nose print, man's -- face high,

281
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,420
視線直對兔寶寶
direct eye-line to baby bunnies.

282
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:47,580
迪蘭來過這
Dylan was here.

283
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:49,300
這家伙就要做家長了
This guy's about to have a kid.

284
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:51,220
-什么樣的成年男性 -它們要醒了
- What kind of adult male -- - They're waking up.

285
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:52,720
它們要醒了
They're waking up.

286
00:10:53,353 --> 00:10:55,103
他不在這
Hey, look, he's not here.

287
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:56,260
我們回派對上去吧
Let's just get back to the parties.

288
00:10:56,693 --> 00:10:59,073
我得先去一趟街對面的自助洗衣店
Ooh, I got to stop at that laundromat across the street.

289
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:01,540
一下就好 我的投注站需要零錢
It'll take a second. I just need change for my squares.

290
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:04,100
有趣 你感興趣的事情你就這么上心
Funny. You're so focused when it's your passion project.

291
00:11:04,164 --> 00:11:05,694
你知道嗎 曼尼
Y-you know what, Manny?

292
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:06,860
你說得對
You're right.

293
00:11:07,140 --> 00:11:09,220
那整件事都是我不好
That whole thing was my bad.

294
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:10,780
謝了 菲爾
Thanks, Phil.

295
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:15,380
我把兩邊門都打開好讓你這大頭癥進得去
Let me get both these doors so you and your ego can fit inside.

296
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:18,780
我不知道你怎么能生我的氣
I don't know how you can get mad at me

297
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:20,680
是你先發了那段丟人的視頻
after posting that humiliating video.

298
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:21,380
什么視頻
What video?

299
00:11:21,580 --> 00:11:23,660
別裝傻
Don't play dumb.

300
00:11:24,744 --> 00:11:27,225
-俺冷 -停
- Me cold. - Cut!

301
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:29,720
"我好冷"
"I'm so cold."

302
00:11:29,905 --> 00:11:32,735
不是"俺冷" 不是"我不是不冷"
Not "Me cold." Not "I'm not not cold."

303
00:11:32,735 --> 00:11:34,205
不是"冰 冰 寶貝"[歌詞]
Not "Ice, ice baby."

304
00:11:34,205 --> 00:11:36,045
沒有正常人會那么說話
No humans say those things!

305
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:38,720
你要人記住的東西太多了
It is so difficult to build a performance

306
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,900
想好好表演太難了
with a constant barrage of notes!

307
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:43,040
就一點 別改臺詞
Note! Say the line!

308
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,620
就三個字
Three words!

309
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,120
你知道我想聽哪幾個字嗎
You know what three words I'd like to hear?

310
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,000
"死得好 菲爾"
"Nice death, Phil!"

311
00:11:48,325 --> 00:11:50,346
我只是想幫你
I'm just trying to help you,

312
00:11:50,346 --> 00:11:51,756
你耍什么大牌
you diva !

313
00:11:52,496 --> 00:11:55,126
而你自己高潮個沒完
And you keep yourself.

314
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:58,280
蠢貨 蠢貨 蠢貨 蠢貨
Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!

315
00:11:58,616 --> 00:12:00,356
難以置信
Unbelievable!

316
00:12:03,660 --> 00:12:07,440
蠢貨 蠢貨 蠢貨 蠢貨 蠢貨
Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!

317
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,920
幸好影片在我真正發飆前就結束了
Fortunately, it cut off right before I really lost it.

318
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,200
曼尼 怎么會是我發的呢
Manny, why would I post a video

319
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:14,600
視頻里說我是"糟糕的演員"
calling myself a "terrible actor"?

320
00:12:16,627 --> 00:12:18,077
很可能是我的剪輯師發的
Could've been my editor.

321
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:20,340
在一次關于創作很強烈的爭執中
During a particularly intense creative discussion,

322
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:22,160
我或許在他女友面前扇了他嘴巴
I may have slapped him in front of his girlfriend.

323
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,080
菲爾 我很抱歉
Phil, I'm sorry.

324
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:26,400
我認為我很鬧心的原因
I think the reason I got frustrated

325
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,760
只有一部分是因為你爛得氣人
is only partly due to your infuriating incompetence.

326
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:30,080
承認起來不難吧
Was that so hard?

327
00:12:30,500 --> 00:12:32,820
別告訴別人 我申請了轉學
Between us, I've applied to transfer

328
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:35,160
去我可以主修會計或法律的學校
to somewhere I can major in accounting or law.

329
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,080
好糊口的專業
Something safe.

330
00:12:36,558 --> 00:12:37,488
我開始質疑
I've started to question

331
00:12:37,488 --> 00:12:39,788
自己是否有拍攝電影的才華
if I have any talent as a filmmaker.

332
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,940
我們來找出答案吧
Let's find out.

333
00:12:41,940 --> 00:12:43,480
影片你帶在身上嗎
You got your film with you?

334
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:44,240
在我手機里
On my phone.

335
00:12:44,420 --> 00:12:46,360
我們有最合適的測試觀眾
We have a perfect test audience.

336
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:48,200
嘗試一把
Take a chance. Let's, uh...

337
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,100
看看你有什么能耐
Let's see what you got.

338
00:12:49,618 --> 00:12:51,428
好吧 我正好也帶了投影儀
Okay. I mean, I got my projector.

339
00:12:51,458 --> 00:12:52,959
屏幕也有了
And a screen.

340
00:12:53,158 --> 00:12:55,128
-好吧 我去準備 -太好了
- All right. I'll set it up. - Great.

341
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,080
與此同時 我變個魔術把場子弄熱
Meanwhile, I'll warm up the crowd with a magic trick.

342
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,640
打擾一下
Excuse me.

343
00:12:58,899 --> 00:13:01,479
請大家把錢包放入這個枕頭套
I need everyone to put their wallets in this pillow case

344
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:03,240
然后面壁站著
and turn and face the wall.

345
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,360
都找遍了 沒人知道迪蘭在哪里
Well, that's it. No one knows where Dylan is.

346
00:13:07,740 --> 00:13:08,400
他們最好趕緊找到他
They better.

347
00:13:08,660 --> 00:13:10,380
她的朋友20分鐘后就會到
Her friends are gonna be here in 20 minutes --

348
00:13:10,579 --> 00:13:12,389
就是那群人在畢業派對上
the same ones who at a graduation party

349
00:13:12,389 --> 00:13:15,199
投票選她最有可能懷孕且沒男人
voted her most likely to be pregnant and alone.

350
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:16,200
就像我總說的那樣
Like I always say --

351
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,440
沒朋友好過有一群毒舌朋友
it's better to have no friends than mean friends.

352
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:19,200
這個嘛
Well...

353
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,700
迪蘭一向遇事就跑
Dylan's always been a runner.

354
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:25,440
天啊 你還記得他以前染金發嗎
God, you remember when he was a blond?

355
00:13:25,730 --> 00:13:27,180
我叫他"瘋染夫人"
Ugh, I called him "Lady Dye-Job"

356
00:13:27,180 --> 00:13:30,070
他就跑走了 我還得去找他...
and he ran off, and I had to track him down...

357
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:33,300
我知道迪蘭在哪了 我知道他在哪
I know where Dylan is. I know where he is!

358
00:13:35,540 --> 00:13:36,020
迪蘭
Dylan.

359
00:13:36,260 --> 00:13:38,100
迪蘭 開門 我是克萊爾
Hey, Dylan, open up. It's Claire.

360
00:13:38,410 --> 00:13:40,250
我不想談 鄧菲太太
I -- I don't want to talk, Mrs. D.

361
00:13:40,250 --> 00:13:41,690
我知道你很難過
Look, I realize you're upset.

362
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:43,640
但小卡 米奇 盧克 菲爾
But those things that Cam and Mitch

363
00:13:43,690 --> 00:13:45,341
還有歌洛莉亞說的那些話
and Luke and Phil and Gloria said,

364
00:13:45,341 --> 00:13:47,971
其實 都只是小誤會
they're -- they were just, uh, silly misunderstandings.

365
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:49,020
好吧
Okay.

366
00:13:49,580 --> 00:13:50,900
可是你說的那些話呢
But what about what you said?

367
00:13:52,261 --> 00:13:53,621
你知道我們得給家里所有柜子
You realize we're gonna have to baby-proof

368
00:13:53,621 --> 00:13:55,271
裝上寶寶防護條吧
all the cabinets at home, right?

369
00:13:55,271 --> 00:13:56,451
想象一下我們看著迪蘭
Think of how cute it'll be

370
00:13:56,451 --> 00:13:58,401
努力想打開柜門 有多好笑
watching Dylan try to get into them.

371
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:03,480
我不該那么說
I shouldn't have said that,

372
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:05,260
我顯然也沒料到...
and I obviously didn't realize --

373
00:14:05,291 --> 00:14:07,281
什么 我能聽懂那個笑話嗎
What? That I would get that joke?

374
00:14:07,281 --> 00:14:08,822
太傷人了 鄧菲太太
The insult set it up, Mrs. D.

375
00:14:08,822 --> 00:14:11,842
-"瘋染夫人"也會受傷的 -迪蘭
- "Lady Dye-Job" has feelings. - Oh, Dylan.

376
00:14:12,180 --> 00:14:14,400
迪蘭 別這樣 親愛的 派對快開始了
Dylan, come on. Honey, the party is starting --

377
00:14:15,362 --> 00:14:17,512
求你了 我很抱歉
Please. I -- I'm sorry.

378
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:19,540
我走了
I'm leaving.

379
00:14:24,092 --> 00:14:25,622
開門 我是岡薩雷斯先生
Open up. It's Mr. Gonzales,

380
00:14:25,622 --> 00:14:26,853
泊車員
the parking attendant.

381
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,700
我又不是傻子 鄧菲太太
I'm not an idiot, Mrs. D.

382
00:14:28,792 --> 00:14:30,642
我知道你去找了岡薩雷斯先生來
I know you just went to get Mr. Gonzales

383
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:33,340
想趁我開門給他時沖進來
so you could run in here when I open the door for him.

384
00:14:48,513 --> 00:14:50,034
迪蘭
Hey. Hey, Dylan?

385
00:14:50,203 --> 00:14:51,354
迪蘭 迪...
Dylan? Dyl--

386
00:14:52,133 --> 00:14:53,164
我靠
Ohh, damn it!

387
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:57,060
能快點嗎 我想回去跟克里斯蒂娜道歉
Can we hurry? I want to get back so I can apologize to Christina.

388
00:14:57,180 --> 00:14:59,180
別啊 莉莉 為什么冒受心傷的險
Oh, no. Lily, why risk your heart?

389
00:14:59,220 --> 00:15:00,420
克里斯蒂娜只會傷害你
Christina will just hurt you.

390
00:15:00,580 --> 00:15:01,760
我完全同意 莉莉
I couldn't agree more, Lily.

391
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,280
如果克里斯蒂娜不懂得欣賞你的體貼 幽默
If Christina doesn't appreciate your warmth, your humor,

392
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:05,580
還有你那些精彩的人生故事
your great stories,

393
00:15:05,914 --> 00:15:06,954
她就不值得你那么在乎她
she's just not worth it.

394
00:15:06,954 --> 00:15:08,944
也許等她老了 孤零零住在那棟大房子里時
Oh, maybe she'll regret taking you for granted

395
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:11,180
她就會后悔當初沒好好珍惜你
when she's old and alone in that big house

396
00:15:11,180 --> 00:15:13,820
并且意識到擁有再多的錢 也無法溫暖她的心
and realizes all that money can't keep her warm.

397
00:15:14,900 --> 00:15:15,740
什么情況
What is happening?

398
00:15:16,744 --> 00:15:18,695
現在還在洗衣店放電影了
Movies in a laundromat now?

399
00:15:18,695 --> 00:15:21,755
嬉皮士就不能讓事物保持原來的樣子嗎
Can't hipsters just let a thing be a thing?

400
00:15:21,765 --> 00:15:25,235
我還有很多話想跟你說 阿列克謝
There is much I wish to say to you, Alexei,

401
00:15:25,415 --> 00:15:27,795
不只是現在 還有未來很長時間
not just now, but for long time.

402
00:15:27,875 --> 00:15:31,385
一次忽視 怎么就葬送了20年的友情呢
How could one slight cost 20 years friendship?

403
00:15:31,555 --> 00:15:35,195
是19世紀俄國人的愚蠢驕傲嗎
Silly 19th century Russian pride?

404
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:38,740
我們為什么沒有勇氣抓住愛呢
Why we not have courage to take chance on love?

405
00:15:38,825 --> 00:15:40,205
我等凡人都是愚者
Fools, us humans.

406
00:15:40,300 --> 00:15:41,060
現在還不算太遲
It's not too late.

407
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:42,280
但我沒時間了
It is for me,

408
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:43,780
我最好最好的朋友
my great, great friend.

409
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:46,300
現在我去天上的大克里姆林宮了
I go now to grand Kremlin in the sky.

410
00:15:49,246 --> 00:15:50,556
好冷啊[辣椒醬]
It's chilly.

411
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:53,160
辣椒醬
Chili.

412
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:54,760
他為什么要提起這個
Why did he have to mention that?

413
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:57,560
我們今早本該一起煮辣椒醬的 小卡
We were supposed to cook together this morning, Cam.

414
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,520
我一直等著你呢
I waited for you.

415
00:15:58,606 --> 00:16:00,756
可我帶著面粉到你家門口了
But I was there on your front porch with flours.

416
00:16:00,756 --> 00:16:01,916
你還記得帶增稠劑
You remembered the thickeners?

417
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,960
我當然記得 我以為你忘了
Of course I did. I thought you forgot.

418
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,000
我還做了件一模一樣的給你
I have an identical one for you!

419
00:16:07,047 --> 00:16:08,827
杰 你不知道這對我來說多有意義
Oh, Jay, you don't know how much this means to me!

420
00:16:08,827 --> 00:16:11,057
莉莉 你必須跟克里斯蒂娜道歉
Lily, you -- you have to apologize to Christina.

421
00:16:11,057 --> 00:16:12,047
沒錯
That's right.

422
00:16:12,047 --> 00:16:14,357
別像我跟小卡 瑟吉和阿列克謝那樣
Don't be like me and Cam and Sergei and Alexei.

423
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:16,180
-自尊心就是毒藥 -沒錯 敞開心扉
- Pride is poison! - Yes, open your heart!

424
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:17,700
讓自己勇敢去愛
Let yourself love!

425
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,500
杰
Jay...

426
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:21,320
所以沒人好奇菲爾姑父
So, nobody's wondering why Uncle Phil

427
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,940
為什么會出演洗衣店電影嗎
is starring in a laundromat movie?

428
00:16:26,147 --> 00:16:28,588
不
N-No-o-o-o!

429
00:16:44,198 --> 00:16:45,279
怎么樣
So?

430
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:46,560
稱不上
It's...

431
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,960
特別優秀
not very good.

432
00:16:48,388 --> 00:16:50,079
我就知道 純屬浪費時間
I knew it. I wasted my time.

433
00:16:50,079 --> 00:16:52,139
但比之前那部電影好多了
But it's much better than the last one,

434
00:16:52,139 --> 00:16:53,919
而且有一幕特別打動我
and there was one moment when Count Ivanovich was --

435
00:16:53,919 --> 00:16:56,089
就是伊萬諾維奇伯爵跟熊下象棋那幕
was playing chess with the bear that really moved me.

436
00:16:56,089 --> 00:16:56,919
那段本來就是
Well, that was supposed to be

437
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:58,319
整部電影的悲情內核體現
the emotional gestalt of the piece.

438
00:16:58,319 --> 00:16:59,899
你甚至能在背景音里聽到我在忍著哭
You can hear me stifle a sob in the cut

439
00:16:59,899 --> 00:17:01,989
這是因為話筒收音員故意壞我電影
because my boom operator was undermining me.

440
00:17:01,989 --> 00:17:04,539
你的劇組真的很有毒
You had an astonishingly toxic set.

441
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,260
聽我說 曼尼 如果我是你父親
Listen, Manny, if I was your dad,

442
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:07,940
我可能會讓你選靠譜的工作
I might tell you to play it safe with your career.

443
00:17:07,940 --> 00:17:08,740
但以粉絲的角度
But as a fan,

444
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:10,940
我迫不及待想看到你未來的作品
I'm dying to see what you come up with next.

445
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,460
-真的嗎 -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

446
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:14,800
我從你這么點大的時候就在聽你編故事
I've been watching you make up stories since you were this big.

447
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,880
我想看到結局
I want to see how it ends.

448
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:16,940
不是這電影的結局
Not that.

449
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:19,310
我是想看到你會走向何方
I-I want to see how this ends.

450
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,000
謝謝你 菲爾
Thanks, Phil.

451
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:23,260
我也想再接再厲
I would like to keep trying,

452
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:24,740
或許拍一些不那么商業化的片子
maybe something not so commercial.

453
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,680
太好了
That's great.

454
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:29,240
但我覺得這大概是我悲劇演員的終點了
I do think it's the end of the road for me as a thespian, though.

455
00:17:29,500 --> 00:17:30,300
這樣也好
Probably best.

456
00:17:30,432 --> 00:17:33,630
我下一部電影有一個你這年紀的角色
Well, I did have a part in my next film for a guy your age,

457
00:17:33,630 --> 00:17:36,121
但你得有傅滿洲那種胡須
but you'd have to grow a Fu Manchu moustache

458
00:17:36,121 --> 00:17:37,761
還得在2周內漲18公斤
and gain 40 pounds in two weeks.

459
00:17:37,761 --> 00:17:39,162
我周二就能準備好
I'll be ready Tuesday.

460
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:41,200
-香菜 -正確
- Cilantro. - Yes.

461
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:43,660
-紅洋蔥丁 -你真厲害
- Diced red onion? - You are good.

462
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,440
還沒猜完你可不許跑
Hey, don't run away with the rest of that.

463
00:17:45,691 --> 00:17:47,561
這是什么離奇畫面
Ugh, what am I looking at?

464
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:50,240
米奇爾 過來展示一下什么是真正的爺們
Mitch, come here. Show them how to be a real man.

465
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:54,150
他收到別人的威脅黒函一整天了
He has been getting threatening texts all day

466
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:58,100
是個逃犯 但他眼皮都不眨一下
from a fugitive, and he hasn't even flinched.

467
00:17:58,160 --> 00:18:00,160
他們就慶幸自己是美嬌男吧
Well, they're lucky they're pretty, right?

468
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,480
老爸 我能借用你的手機嗎
Daddy, can I borrow your phone?

469
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,480
我想跟克里斯蒂娜道歉
I want to apologize to Christina.

470
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:08,300
莉莉 不行 他的手機可能會成為
Lily, no. His phone might be evidence

471
00:18:08,402 --> 00:18:10,592
-謀殺審判庭上的證物 -誰被殺
- in a murder trial. - Whose?

472
00:18:11,160 --> 00:18:13,760
小寶貝 你都用你小爸的手機跟朋友發短信嗎
Sweetie, have you been using Daddy's phone to text your friend?

473
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:15,400
是啊 我說了一些很毒的話
Yeah, and I said some mean stuff.

474
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,180
她估計也沒少罵回來
She's probably been texting me back.

475
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,920
天啊 好吧 行
My God. Okay, okay.

476
00:18:20,922 --> 00:18:22,673
"我現在就在你家外
"I'm -- I'm right outside your house.

477
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,920
一切到此結束"
This ends now."

478
00:18:25,283 --> 00:18:26,823
"對了 你的發型真難看"
"P.S., your hair's ugly."

479
00:18:26,823 --> 00:18:28,953
她吹牛逼呢 她才不在外面
It's a bluff. She's not out there.

480
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,720
但如果你想去確認的話就去吧
I mean, if you want to go check, check.

481
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:33,540
如果你能去看一眼的話
You know, us weaklings would feel so much better

482
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:35,780
我們小弱雞會安心許多 拜托了
if you would just take a quick look. Please.

483
00:18:36,053 --> 00:18:38,013
身為一個法界人士與保護者
Well, as -- as lawman and protector,

484
00:18:38,013 --> 00:18:41,193
這點小事不足... 不足掛齒
that is something that I -- I can do.

485
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,860
謝謝你了 迪蘭
Thank you for this, Dylan,

486
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:56,180
我很感謝你愿意原諒我
and I appreciate you forgiving me

487
00:18:56,180 --> 00:18:57,940
之前說的那些蠢話
for the dumb thing I said earlier.

488
00:18:58,224 --> 00:18:59,374
誰說我原諒你了
Who said I forgave you?

489
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:00,480
我為你包扎傷口
I'm only treating your injury

490
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,900
純粹是因為你正在我家做客
because you're a guest in my home.

491
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:06,900
我知道表面上看來 我一直沒接納你
I know it may seem that I haven't always accepted you,

492
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:10,580
但我剛認識你那會兒 你是個穿著皮夾克
but when I met you, you were an 18-year-old in a leather jacket

493
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:12,580
泡我15歲女兒的18歲男孩
dating my 15-year-old daughter.

494
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:13,540
我理解
I get it.

495
00:19:13,635 --> 00:19:15,085
你也是想保護你女兒
You were trying to protect your daughter

496
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:16,040
不被我這種男人染指
from a guy like me,

497
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,440
但我已經有很久沒當"我這樣的男人"了
but I haven't been a guy like me for a long time.

498
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:19,800
彎曲[通融]一下
Bend for me.

499
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,780
很難啊 迪蘭
It's hard, Dylan.

500
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:22,720
我當了那么多年的護女狂魔...
I have been a mama bear for so long...

501
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,780
不是 是彎起手肘
No, your elbow.

502
00:19:25,620 --> 00:19:26,060
好的
Okay.

503
00:19:26,895 --> 00:19:29,755
只... 只是一切都發展太快
It's j-- It's all happening so fast.

504
00:19:29,765 --> 00:19:31,385
但已經在發展了
But it is happening.

505
00:19:31,385 --> 00:19:34,076
我馬上就要成為你孫兒的父親了
I'm about to be the father to your grandbabies.

506
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,520
伸出手吧
Reach out a little.

507
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,620
我是指用心
I meant emotionally.

508
00:19:38,740 --> 00:19:40,280
我敢直面鏡子
I can look myself in the mirror

509
00:19:40,280 --> 00:19:41,740
